t/ga#hitPointsInTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healInTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageInTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#exportKey>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"The Ed25519 public key this game signs its passports with, as base64 of the raw 32 bytes. A receiving game verifies a passport against the key in its own copy of the issuing game's published profile, never against a key the passport carries.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#exportKey>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#exportKey>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"True when every move in this game has an elemental type.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#moveName>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"What a creature's attack is called.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#moveName>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hitPoints>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"A creature's own health, in the source game's hit points.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hitPoints>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#bonusHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Health granted above the maximum. Not every game allows it.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#bonusHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Hit points restored, in the source game's hit points.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Damage of one hit or one move, in the source game's hit points.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t